+
+        Regression: 2026-05-19 — C0B4PCSJHFC group-DM thread bypassed
+        strict_mention because the original line 1933 classification
+        (`channel_type in {"im", "mpim"}`) treated mpim as a DM. See
+        memory/scars/2026-05-19-cursor-mcp-bot-username-misdiagnosis.md.
+        """
